16:26.960 --> 16:28.830
<b>Okay, Ririsa.</b>

16:28.830 --> 16:30.290
<b>Thanks, Senpai!</b>

16:31.960 --> 16:33.920
<b>Are you watching the OVA?!</b>

16:33.920 --> 16:35.500
<b>Huh? Oh, yeah.</b>

16:35.500 --> 16:37.710
<b>I could never get my hands on it!</b>

16:37.710 --> 16:39.540
<b>Yeah, it's pretty old.</b>

16:39.540 --> 16:43.420
<b>A shame, really, since there are so many
scenes that make it a work of art.</b>

16:43.420 --> 16:44.880
<b>Of course you'd know!</b>

16:44.880 --> 16:46.330
<b>Please, tell me everything!</b>

16:46.330 --> 16:48.710
<b>W-well, if you insist!</b>

16:49.420 --> 16:53.670
<b>Up until now, she's been feeling overwhelmed
by the pressure to help her friends,</b>

16:53.670 --> 16:56.580
<b>but right here, she finally realizes how much
her friends have been helping her, too,</b>

16:56.580 --> 16:58.040
<b>but she doesn't say it out loud!</b>

16:58.040 --> 16:59.040
<b>Really?!</b>

16:59.040 --> 17:00.630
<b>Cause you can see it on her face! See?</b>

17:00.630 --> 17:03.880
<b>Forget flashy lasers or smooth motion,
this attention to detail is godlike animation!</b>

17:03.880 --> 17:05.290
<b>How do you know so much?!</b>

17:05.290 --> 17:07.290
<b>I've done my research.</b>

17:07.290 --> 17:09.080
<b>Wait, senpai...</b>

17:10.170 --> 17:12.670
<b>How is this part of your research?</b>

17:12.670 --> 17:14.210
<b>Wanna see?</b>

17:15.830 --> 17:17.040
<b>Senpai, you're cheating!</b>

17:17.040 --> 17:18.790
<b>Nope, this is all in the game!</b>

17:18.790 --> 17:20.960
<b>Holy shit! This is so fun!</b>

17:18.790 --> 17:20.580
<b>Then I'm gonna pick a different fighter next time,</b>

17:20.580 --> 17:21.880
<b>either Nasu or Gorgon!</b>

17:20.960 --> 17:23.250
<b>I always wanted a cool kohai like this!</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:27.330
<b>I never should've worried about her.
She's the perfect otaku buddy!</b>

17:27.330 --> 17:29.580
<b>Senpai, mind if I try pausing a little?</b>

17:29.580 --> 17:30.290
<b>Huh? Oh, yeah.</b>

17:33.290 --> 17:34.130
<b>Yes!</b>

17:34.580 --> 17:36.630
<b>You can see her undies in a few frames!</b>

17:36.630 --> 17:38.460
<b>What is she, a horny thirteen-year-old boy?!</b>

17:38.460 --> 17:41.540
<b>Whenever I see a sexy outfit,
I have to write down all the little details!</b>

17:41.540 --> 17:43.500
<b>Yeah, that makes sense.</b>

17:43.630 --> 17:47.330
<b>I want my cosplays to be
as realistic as possible.</b>

17:47.330 --> 17:50.130
<b>That way, I can bring
each character into real life.</b>

17:50.540 --> 17:53.250
<b>I want people to see my cosplay</b>

17:53.250 --> 17:55.880
<b>and think their favorite character
really exists before them!</b>

17:56.330 --> 17:57.540
<b>I get it now.</b>

17:57.540 --> 17:59.880
<b>That's why I reacted to her...</b>

17:59.880 --> 18:00.710
<b>Senpai!</b>

18:02.290 --> 18:04.380
<b>I need to get into my cosplay, right now!</b>

18:05.000 --> 18:06.210
<b>Can I get changed?!</b>

18:06.210 --> 18:07.290
<b>You're already changing!</b>

18:08.670 --> 18:09.290
<b>C'mon, idiot!</b>

18:09.290 --> 18:12.080
<b>I'm just impressed by how
high-quality her cosplay was!</b>

18:12.080 --> 18:14.080
<b>I am NOT in love with her!</b>

18:14.080 --> 18:15.380
<b>Thanks for being patient!</b>

18:16.710 --> 18:17.920
<b>I am not...</b>

18:19.210 --> 18:23.630
<b>Today, I went with the training outfit
from the Angel Academy spin-off.</b>

18:26.290 --> 18:28.250
<b>Wow, looks good.</b>

18:28.250 --> 18:30.000
<b>What do you need me to do?</b>

18:30.000 --> 18:30.630
<b>Right!</b>

18:30.630 --> 18:33.250
<b>Could you take some pictures of me,
just on your phone?</b>

18:33.250 --> 18:34.880
<b>Sure, but I don't know what I'm doing.</b>

18:34.880 --> 18:36.670
<b>Just let your love for Liliel guide you!</b>

18:36.670 --> 18:38.040
<b>That's not gonna help!</b>

18:40.580 --> 18:44.670
<b>I'll pose here.
You just keep clicking away!</b>

18:44.670 --> 18:45.500
<b>Okay...</b>

19:01.540 --> 19:04.420
<b>ANGEL ACADEMY</b>

19:01.540 --> 19:04.420
<b>Chapter 81</b>

19:01.830 --> 19:04.420
<b>That's the front page from
Chapter 81 of the spin-off!</b>

19:05.250 --> 19:06.540
<b>In real life!</b>

19:06.790 --> 19:07.750
<b>Senpai?</b>

19:08.670 --> 19:10.250
<b>Right, sorry!</b>

19:14.000 --> 19:15.040
<b>She's so cute.</b>

19:17.420 --> 19:18.500
<b>Perfect...</b>

19:21.250 --> 19:22.920
<b>This is so much fun!</b>

19:22.920 --> 19:24.880
<b>I'm gonna try another costume.</b>

19:24.880 --> 19:26.960
<b>Wait, you have more?</b>

19:27.920 --> 19:29.380
<b>All ready!</b>

19:29.380 --> 19:31.630
<b>Whoa, that's her third squad uniform!</b>

19:34.460 --> 19:38.170
<b>Damn, I have no idea what angles
will make her look good,</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:40.540
<b>but this is actually really fun!</b>

19:40.540 --> 19:42.580
<b>How do I look? Can I see?</b>

19:43.000 --> 19:44.130
<b>Sure, here.</b>

19:45.170 --> 19:47.000
<b>These are incredible!</b>

19:47.000 --> 19:50.670
<b>You're awesome, Senpai!
My Liliel looks mega cute!</b>

19:51.500 --> 19:52.790
<b>Guess my passion did guide me.</b>

19:52.960 --> 19:56.210
<b>I knew it would! See this first pose?</b>

19:57.040 --> 19:59.380
<b>It looks just like the art from that chapter!</b>

20:00.750 --> 20:03.580
<b>You can feel my love
for Liliel coming through!</b>

20:03.960 --> 20:06.420
<b>I'm so glad I asked you to help!</b>

20:07.500 --> 20:08.250
<b>This one's good, too!</b>

20:08.250 --> 20:11.040
<b>Damn, she really does love Liliel.</b>

20:08.250 --> 20:09.210
<b>This one's good, too!</b>

20:09.210 --> 20:13.960
<b>And this one, too! The next few are so cute...</b>

20:11.040 --> 20:13.960
<b>That's why she found the courage to ask me to help.</b>

20:14.960 --> 20:16.920
<b>It's already this late?</b>

20:17.790 --> 20:19.540
<b>I'll change back into my uniform, then.</b>

20:19.540 --> 20:20.380
<b>Okay.</b>

20:21.630 --> 20:25.000
<b>I promised her I'd never feel a thing from her.</b>

20:25.000 --> 20:27.210
<b>There's no going back on that.</b>

20:27.210 --> 20:29.710
<b>She's just the coolest kohai
I could ever ask for.</b>

20:30.040 --> 20:32.420
<b>I'll support her with the purest intentions.</b>

20:32.710 --> 20:34.420
<b>Um, Senpai?</b>

20:35.420 --> 20:37.250
<b>My zipper's kinda stuck.</b>

20:37.250 --> 20:39.500
<b>Could you help me undress?</b>

20:39.500 --> 20:41.960
<b>HELP YOU WHAT?!</b>

20:39.920 --> 20:41.790
<b>HELP YOU WHAT!!?</b>

20:42.330 --> 20:44.420
<b>Just give the zipper a tug!</b>

20:44.420 --> 20:45.790
<b>See, right here?</b>

20:45.790 --> 20:47.920
<b>Um, sure, okay.</b>

20:49.080 --> 20:51.580
<b>Damn, it's really stuck...</b>

20:51.580 --> 20:55.670
<b>Yeah. I made it myself,
so it's probably a little janky-</b>

20:59.540 --> 21:00.670
<b>There!</b>

21:00.670 --> 21:02.830
<b>Hell yeah, I didn't see shit!</b>

21:02.830 --> 21:04.210
<b>Thanks, Senpai...</b>

21:05.500 --> 21:06.250
<b>Lili-</b>

21:09.290 --> 21:11.170
<b>Liliel, are you okay?!</b>

21:14.250 --> 21:16.380
<b>I mean, uh, Ririsa.</b>

21:17.210 --> 21:20.580
<b>I'm okay. Thanks for catching me...</b>

21:22.920 --> 21:24.460
<b>...Ashford-sama.</b>

21:27.080 --> 21:29.000
<b>Very funny, Ririsa!</b>

21:29.790 --> 21:31.130
<b>Sorry, Senpai.</b>

21:31.830 --> 21:35.500
<b>So, uh... Could you let go of me?</b>

21:36.210 --> 21:36.920
<b>Huh?</b>

21:40.040 --> 21:41.920
<b>Sorry, I didn't mean to!</b>

21:41.920 --> 21:43.170
<b>I know.</b>

21:43.170 --> 21:46.540
<b>It's gonna take some time to change,
so feel free to head out without me.</b>

21:46.540 --> 21:48.880
<b>You got it! Okay, bye!</b>

21:50.170 --> 21:53.040
<b>What is wrong with me?!</b>

22:08.250 --> 22:11.250
<b>He's a lot stronger than he looks.</b>

22:12.130 --> 22:14.670
<b>Why's my heart racing so fast?</b>

22:15.670 --> 22:17.170
<b>Something's off...</b>

22:20.250 --> 22:22.330
<b>Am I coming down with a fever?</b>

22:22.630 --> 22:24.670
<b>I'd better take some medicine
when I get home!</b>

23:56.040 --> 24:01.040
<b>Cosplay Group Potential?</b>
